    "notes": "POST form: keyword=&sector=&subsector=&pageNo=N&pageSize=50&cmpySortType=ASC&symbolSortType=ASC. Response is an HTML fragment — parse table rows for company name, stock symbol, sector, subsector, listing date (and the cmpy_id in the row link). Use cmpy_id to fetch per-company disclosures + financial reports (PHP). Listed companies only. Join to SEC by name (SEC reg/TIN not on PSE)."
